        <title>hyprnote</title>
        <link>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/hyprnote/</link>
        <pubDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 15:38:13 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/hyprnote/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1657806094616-96bdde021fa5?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3NTQwMzM3OTR8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post hyprnote" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;fastreplhyprnote&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/fastrepl/hyprnote&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;fastrepl/hyprnote&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5fac942-1a51-4180-9d64-f508db705f9d&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;github_banner_v2&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;AI notepad for &lt;strong&gt;private&lt;/strong&gt; meetings. Not a single byte of data leaves your device.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
   &lt;a href=&#34;https://deepwiki.com/fastrepl/hyprnote&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://deepwiki.com/badge.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Ask DeepWiki&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
   &lt;a href=&#34;https://hyprnote.com/discord&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=Join%20our&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=blue&amp;logo=Discord&#34; alt=&#34;Discord&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
   &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/tryhyprnote&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=Follow%20us%20on&amp;message=X&amp;color=black&amp;logo=x&#34; alt=&#34;X&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-hyprnote&#34;&gt;What is Hyprnote?
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hyprnote is a local-first AI notepad designed for people in back-to-back meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Listens to your meetings while you write&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crafts smart summaries based on your quick notes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Runs completely &lt;strong&gt;offline&lt;/strong&gt; using open-source models like Whisper or HyprLLM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No clouds. No leaks. Just your notes—on your machine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;installation&#34;&gt;Installation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;brew tap fastrepl/hyprnote &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; brew install hyprnote --cask
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hyprnote.com/download&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;macOS&lt;/a&gt; (public beta)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/fastrepl/hyprnote/issues/66&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Windows&lt;/a&gt; (soon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/fastrepl/hyprnote/issues/67&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Linux&lt;/a&gt; (of course)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;highlights&#34;&gt;Highlights
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;realtime-transcript&#34;&gt;Realtime Transcript
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Watch a live transcript update as the meeting unfolds—accurate, fast, and fully local.
&lt;img width=&#34;959&#34; height=&#34;712&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d24b8b43-a052-44cd-803e-daa3ff600a9c&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;from-memos-to-summaries&#34;&gt;From Memos to Summaries
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jot things down during your call. Hyprnote turns them into a polished meeting summary—context-aware and easy to share.
&lt;img width=&#34;959&#34; height=&#34;712&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/489f9239-1a32-4217-9d74-554906687fe1&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;truly-local&#34;&gt;Truly Local
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;No internet? No problem. Hyprnote works offline by default and keeps everything on your device.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6649a63-3d41-40ea-a1fd-8c0713ad91bc&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;offline&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;bring-your-own-llm&#34;&gt;Bring Your Own LLM
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prefer something custom? You can swap in your own language model:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run local models via Ollama&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use approved third-party APIs like Gemini, Claude, or Azure-hosted GPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay compliant with whatever your org allows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hyprnote plays nice with whatever stack you’re running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img width=&#34;912&#34; height=&#34;712&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/717dc39a-3359-46d6-a92f-51de56907750&#34; /&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;note-templates&#34;&gt;Note Templates
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prefer a certain style? Choose from predefined templates like bullet points, agenda-based, or paragraph summary. Or create your own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img width=&#34;959&#34; height=&#34;712&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d826a854-4b6f-415c-9e97-270f517c0868&#34; /&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;autonomy-selector&#34;&gt;Autonomy Selector
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Control how much freedom the AI takes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stick strictly to your quick notes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Let Hyprnote improvise and reframe based on the full conversation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;img width=&#34;912&#34; height=&#34;712&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7de5c74f-5d99-46ec-8a5f-a38fb62bafb1&#34; /&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;ai-chat&#34;&gt;AI Chat
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ask follow-ups right inside your notes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;ldquo;What were the action items?&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;ldquo;Rewrite this in simpler language&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;ldquo;Translate to Spanish&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;img width=&#34;959&#34; height=&#34;712&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52b7dc14-906f-445f-91f9-b0089d40a495&#34; /&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;integrations&#34;&gt;Integrations
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apple Calendar, Contacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsidian&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coming soon: Notion, Slack, Hubspot, Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;img width=&#34;912&#34; height=&#34;712&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab559e54-fda5-4c8c-97d7-ba1b9d134cc8&#34; /&gt;
</description>
